<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Spieker restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Spieker restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had restarted coverage of Spieker Properties Inc with ratings of near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The Menlo Park, Calif., company's shares closed at 35-3/4 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
